cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this gate in your repositories, cite it as below."
title: "platino-ai-gate"
abstract: >-
  Two git hooks (commit-msg and pre-push) that require every commit to declare
  which AI model produced it, and reject "Model: none" on any commit that is not
  a merge, a revert or automation. The model allowlist, the exemption file and
  the falsifier test suite ship with the hooks.
